  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to EAC Partnership Fund from July 2018 to June 2019</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark has supported the East African Community regional integration agenda for sometimes using various mechanism, including the East African Community Partnership Fund (EAC &#x2013; PF, 2012 - 2018). Overtime, some encouraging results have been achieved. 

This support will build on the positive experiences from previous supports and continue the support to the EAC integration process with the view to enhance trade and competitivenes. Further it will supports on going efforts to improved opportunities for the private sector growth for inclusive growth, job creation and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased intra region trade and investments with objective of contributing to member state&apos;s growth and poverty reduction</narrative>
  </description>
